---
title: UML Sequence Diagram — Petugas Menyelesaikan Laporan dengan Verifikasi Foto
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor P as Petugas Kebersihan
  participant UI as Aplikasi Web (React)
  participant API as API Worker (Hono)
  participant RS as ReportService
  participant R2 as Penyimpanan Foto (R2)
  participant DB as Database (D1)
  participant VIS as LLM Vision (Gemini)

  P->>UI: Pindai QR lantai, pilih nama
  UI->>API: GET /api/reports/open?building&floor
  API->>DB: SELECT laporan status ≠ resolved
  DB-->>API: laporan terbuka
  API-->>UI: daftar laporan + ringkasan AI
  P->>UI: Bersihkan toilet, ambil foto bukti
  UI->>API: POST /api/uploads (foto bukti)
  API->>R2: simpan foto
  R2-->>API: proof_photo_key
  API-->>UI: proof_photo_key
  UI->>API: PATCH /api/reports/:id {status: resolved, staff_id, proof_photo_key}
  API->>DB: cek petugas aktif
  API->>RS: changeStatus()
  RS->>R2: baca foto bukti
  RS->>VIS: checkProofPhoto(foto, lokasi, keluhan)
  alt verifikasi gagal (error / timeout)
    RS->>R2: hapus foto
    RS->>DB: INSERT activity_log (verification_failed)
    RS-->>API: verification-failed
    API-->>UI: 502 coba lagi
  else verdict = dirty / not_toilet
    VIS-->>RS: verdict + alasan
    RS->>R2: hapus foto
    RS->>DB: INSERT activity_log (proof_rejected)
    RS-->>API: proof-rejected
    API-->>UI: 422 foto ditolak + alasan
    UI-->>P: Minta bersihkan & foto ulang
  else verdict = clean
    VIS-->>RS: clean + alasan
    RS->>DB: UPDATE reports (status=resolved, staff_name, proof_*)
    RS->>DB: INSERT activity_log (status_changed)
    RS-->>API: ok
    API-->>UI: 200 {status: resolved, verification}
    UI-->>P: Laporan selesai
  end
